---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="PULSS — Kelly-Leontine Merilo">
  <div class="cs-wrap">

    <!-- ── HERO ── -->
    <section class="cs-hero">
      <div class="cs-hero-left">
        <p class="cs-tag"><span class="tag-dot"></span>PULSS</p>
        <h1 class="cs-title">Charity Youth<br/>Festival Website</h1>
        <p class="cs-desc">
          PULSS is an imaginary youth festival in Tallinn with the goal of giving
          young people a chance to actually participate, not just be part of the
          audience. I designed the website in Figma as part of my UI Design 1 course.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://www.figma.com/proto/v5nvqOsmZDn97oRbh7aSSH/Pulss?node-id=133-94&t=4hsX65caN3ZD1uSv-1&scaling=min-zoom&content-scaling=fixed&page-id=0%3A1&starting-point-node-id=133%3A94&show-proto-sidebar=1"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="cs-btn"
        >Prototype</a>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-hero-right">
        <div class="cs-mockup">
          <img src="/pulss-screen1.png" alt="PULSS landing page" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── DIVIDER ── -->
    <div class="cs-divider"></div>

    <!-- ── CHALLENGE ── -->
    <section class="cs-section">
      <div class="cs-section-left">
        <h2 class="cs-section-title">The Challenge</h2>
        <p class="cs-body">
          The hardest part for me was finding the right vibe — something that didn't
          feel too clinical but also not too chaotic, while still keeping that
          charitable feeling intact. The red and blue the client provided were also
          quite challenging since finding the right shades that worked together took
          a lot of trial and error.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-section-right">
        <div class="cs-deco cs-deco-stars">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 120 80" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M70 18l3 9h9l-7 5 3 9-8-6-8 6 3-9-7-5h9z" fill="#FF2D55"/>
            <path d="M95 8l2 5h5l-4 3 2 5-5-3-5 3 2-5-4-3h5z" fill="#FF2D55" opacity=".6"/>
            <path d="M45 30l2 5h5l-4 3 2 5-5-3-5 3 2-5-4-3h5z" fill="#FF2D55" opacity=".8"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── DIVIDER ── -->
    <div class="cs-divider"></div>

    <!-- ── PROCESS ── -->
    <section class="cs-section">
      <div class="cs-section-left">
        <h2 class="cs-section-title">The Process</h2>
        <p class="cs-body">
          Finding the visual style required a lot of experimentation. I used red as
          an accent color but decided to go with a different color for the CTAs. I
          chose dark tones to capture the feeling of a festival. The main focus was
          on the desktop view but I also designed a mobile version alongside it. I
          tried working with a design system and reusable components for the first time.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-section-right">
        <div class="cs-deco cs-deco-phone">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 80 120" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="10" y="4" width="60" height="112" rx="8" stroke="#FF2D55" stroke-width="3"/>
            <rect x="20" y="20" width="40" height="68" rx="2" stroke="#FF2D55" stroke-width="2" opacity=".6"/>
            <circle cx="40" cy="100" r="5" stroke="#FF2D55" stroke-width="2"/>
            <path d="M28 54l8 10 16-18" stroke="#FF2D55" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── SCREENS STRIP ── -->
    <div class="cs-screens-strip">
      <div class="cs-screen-item">
        <img src="/pulss-screen1.png" alt="PULSS landing page" />
        <p class="cs-screen-label">Landing page</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-screen-item">
        <img src="/pulss-screen2.png" alt="PULSS key screens" />
        <p class="cs-screen-label">Key screens</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-screen-item">
        <img src="/pulss-screen3.png" alt="PULSS registration" />
        <p class="cs-screen-label">Registration</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ── DIVIDER ── -->
    <div class="cs-divider"></div>

    <!-- ── LEARNED ── -->
    <section class="cs-section">
      <div class="cs-section-left">
        <h2 class="cs-section-title">What I Learned</h2>
        <p class="cs-body">
          The schedule section still isn't where I want it to be, but with better
          references it's something I could improve in the future.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-section-right">
        <div class="cs-btn-row">
          <a
            href="https://www.figma.com/proto/v5nvqOsmZDn97oRbh7aSSH/Pulss?node-id=133-94&t=4hsX65caN3ZD1uSv-1&scaling=min-zoom&content-scaling=fixed&page-id=0%3A1&starting-point-node-id=133%3A94&show-proto-sidebar=1"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="cs-btn"
          >Vaata Festivali</a>
          <a
            href="https://www.figma.com/proto/v5nvqOsmZDn97oRbh7aSSH/Pulss?node-id=133-94&t=4hsX65caN3ZD1uSv-1&scaling=min-zoom&content-scaling=fixed&page-id=0%3A1&starting-point-node-id=133%3A94&show-proto-sidebar=1"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="cs-btn cs-btn-outline"
          >Vaata Programmi</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── PROTOTYPE CTA ── -->
    <div class="cs-proto-wrap">
      <a
        href="https://www.figma.com/proto/v5nvqOsmZDn97oRbh7aSSH/Pulss?node-id=133-94&t=4hsX65caN3ZD1uSv-1&scaling=min-zoom&content-scaling=fixed&page-id=0%3A1&starting-point-node-id=133%3A94&show-proto-sidebar=1"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="cs-proto-btn"
      >PROTOTYPE</a>
    </div>

    <!-- ── BACK ── -->
    <div class="cs-back">
      <a href="/#projects" class="cs-back-link">← Back to works</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* ── base ── */
  .cs-wrap {
    background: #080820;
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding-top: 56px; /* nav */
    color: #fff;
    font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* ── hero ── */
  .cs-hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    padding: 72px 80px 60px;
    align-items: center;
    max-width: 1300px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .cs-hero-left {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .cs-tag {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: #FF2D55;
  }
  .tag-dot {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #FF2D55;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .cs-title {
    font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 52px);
    color: #fff;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .cs-desc {
    font-size: clamp(14px, 1.2vw, 16px);
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .cs-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #3355FF;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    padding: 10px 28px;
    text-decoration: none;
    align-self: flex-start;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .cs-btn:hover { background: #5577ff; }

  .cs-btn-outline {
    background: transparent;
    border: 2px solid #3355FF;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .cs-btn-outline:hover { background: #3355FF; }

  .cs-hero-right {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .cs-mockup {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 520px;
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 45, 85, 0.3);
    overflow: hidden;
    line-height: 0;
  }
  .cs-mockup img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  /* ── divider ── */
  .cs-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(255, 45, 85, 0.2);
    margin: 0 80px;
  }

  /* ── sections ── */
  .cs-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    padding: 56px 80px;
    max-width: 1300px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .cs-section-title {
    font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.5vw, 20px);
    color: #FF2D55;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .cs-body {
    font-size: clamp(14px, 1.1vw, 16px);
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  /* ── deco svgs ── */
  .cs-deco {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .cs-deco-stars svg { width: 160px; height: auto; }
  .cs-deco-phone svg { width: 90px; height: auto; }

  .cs-btn-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  /* ── screens strip ── */
  .cs-screens-strip {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 0 80px 56px;
    max-width: 1300px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .cs-screen-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .cs-screen-item img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,45,85,0.25);
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .cs-screen-item:hover img { border-color: rgba(255,45,85,0.6); }

  .cs-screen-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  }

  /* ── prototype cta ── */
  .cs-proto-wrap {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 56px 80px 64px;
  }

  .cs-proto-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #3355FF;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: 'Carter One', sans-serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    padding: 18px 80px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .cs-proto-btn:hover { background: #5577ff; }

  /* ── back ── */
  .cs-back {
    padding: 0 80px 48px;
  }
  .cs-back-link {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .cs-back-link:hover { color: #FF2D55; }

  /* ── responsive ── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .cs-hero,
    .cs-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: 48px 24px;
      gap: 32px;
    }
    .cs-divider { margin: 0 24px; }
    .cs-screens-strip { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 0 24px 48px; }
    .cs-proto-wrap { padding: 40px 24px 48px; }
    .cs-back { padding: 0 24px 40px; }
  }
</style>
